{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20480","headline":"奉和陕州十四翁中丞寄雷州二十二翁司户之作 · 张籍","name":"奉和陕州十四翁中丞寄雷州二十二翁司户之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"联飞独不前，迥落海南天。\n贾傅竟行矣，邵公惟泫然。\n瘴开山更远，路极水无边。\n沈劣本多感，况闻原上篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张籍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20480.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20480","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}